  - Collision mesh packaging and visual GLB conversion / Draco compression.
  - Shared `visual_glb/` layouts and link-canonical gripper visuals.
  - Runtime manifests, overlays, and integrity budgets used by tests.

### End-effectors (Gripper G2, Bio Gripper G2, Lite6 Gripper, Lite6 Vacuum)

Visual and collision meshes for accessories follow the same upstream family
where noted in each `assets/urdf/<name>/README.md`. Combo URDFs, movable
visual variants, and compressed GLBs are maintained in this repository.

